e obligations primarily related to the Aspire Defence project, which has contract terms extending through 2041. Remaining performance obligations do not include variable consideration that was determined to be constrained as of October 2, 2026.\nWe recognized revenue of $213 million and $228 million for the nine months ended October 2, 2026 and October 3, 2025, respectively, which was previously included in the contract liability balance at the beginning of each period.\nChanges in Project-related Estimates\n"}
